WEBVTT

00:15:59.924 --> 00:16:02.972
because this is terribly
costly for hospitals,

00:16:02.996 --> 00:16:07.225
and they will not fully
recover their losses,

00:16:07.249 --> 00:16:08.641
hospitals will go broke,

00:16:08.665 --> 00:16:10.593
even though we know that they need them.

00:16:10.617 --> 00:16:13.601
So you have to go entity by entity

00:16:13.625 --> 00:16:14.785
through this.

00:16:14.809 --> 00:16:17.387
And then you'll go through
the process of who will pay.

00:16:17.411 --> 00:16:19.339
So this is not --

00:16:19.363 --> 00:16:22.139
You know, some people mistake this as --

00:16:22.163 --> 00:16:27.333
There is a virus,
and the virus may come and go, OK?

00:16:27.357 --> 00:16:28.712
Maybe we never see it again.

00:16:28.736 --> 00:16:30.117
I don't think that's likely,